Scope of this license

This license covers only the source code of this repository: the build and
data-preparation scripts, the HTML template, the JavaScript and CSS written for
this project, and the tests.

It does not cover:

- the data in data/ and the network built from it, which come from third
  parties under their own terms;
- the libraries and fonts in vendor/, which keep their own licenses;
- the name "Urbe Hub" and the Urbe Hub logo (brand/urbe-hub-donor.png), which
  are not licensed for reuse.

The terms of the third-party material are listed in THIRD_PARTY.md.
